    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR3j0009-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-9a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T06:33:22.197+09:00">本篇主要阐述生命的延续是根本。文章指出应重视生命而轻视外物，凡“利于性者则取之，害于性者则舍之"。但世上富贵之人大多重物轻生，对物质享受追求不已，这样做的结果必然导致伤生亡国。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:39:44.17+09:00">幸运地得到了，就不顾及性命地去享用，【遁:读“循"，与'徇”，以身徇物之意。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T06:37:16.63+09:00">【三百六十节:指人的周身所有关节。《素问•六节藏象论》:"计人亦有三百六十五节。”利:通畅。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:33:14.754+09:00">就必定灭亡，无可幸免。【无幸必亡:此句是倒装句,意为必定灭亡，无可幸免。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:34:34.98+09:00">耳朵听到它肯定感觉舒服，【punctuates differently: 慊：满足,惬意。   已:语气词，用于语尾，表示确定。】</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:20:26.848+09:00">最初创造出生命的</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T17:20:33.682+09:00">是上天，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:10:02.515+09:00">养护生命并使它长成的</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:10:08.608+09:00">是人。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:10:13.316+09:00">能够养护上天创造的生命而不触犯它，这样的人称作天子。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:10:29.321+09:00">天子的行为</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:10:35.895+09:00">是把全面的爱护生命作为要务的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:10:45.263+09:00">这是设立职官的原因。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:11:01.379+09:00">设立职官，是为了爱护生命啊。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:11:10.387+09:00">如今世上胡涂的君主，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:11:21.438+09:00">大量设立官职却反而因此妨害生命，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:11:24.731+09:00">这就失去了设立职官的初衰了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:22:36.473+09:00">譬如制作武器,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:23:06.291+09:00">是用以防备强盗的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:23:13.851+09:00">可是如今制作的武器反而用来攻杀自己，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-10a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:23:38.014+09:00">那就失去了制作武器的本来目的了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:23:53.846+09:00">水的本质是清澈的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:24:12.774+09:00">与泥土混浊这一起，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:24:21.189+09:00">水就无法保持清澈了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:24:32.591+09:00">人的本质是可以长寿的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:29:45.659+09:00">与外物扰乱在一起，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:29:52.27+09:00">人就无法达到长寿。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:30:06.726+09:00">外物的作用，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:30:22.092+09:00">是用来供养生命的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:30:26.704+09:00">而不是用生命作代价去追求外物。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:30:48.838+09:00">可是如今世上糊涂的人</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:31:03.977+09:00">大多以损耗生命去追求外物，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:31:17.84+09:00">这样作是不懂得轻重。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:31:28.839+09:00">不懂得轻重，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:31:32.357+09:00">就会把重的当作轻的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:31:38.608+09:00">把轻的当作重的了。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:31:45.98+09:00">如果这样作,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:32:09.097+09:00">做每一件事都是要失败的。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:32:30.48+09:00">持这种态度做君主，就会迷乱乘背;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:32:37.829+09:00">做臣子，就会败乱国祸政;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:32:49.119+09:00">做儿子，就会狂妄无礼。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-11a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:33:00.242+09:00">国家只要有这三种情况中的一种，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:34:00.202+09:00">现在如果有这样一种声音，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:34:47.978+09:00">但听了之后，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:34:56.362+09:00">就会使人耳聋，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:35:02.327+09:00">人们一定不会去听。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:35:15.886+09:00">如果有这样一种颜色，眼睛看到它肯定感到悦目，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:35:27.474+09:00">但看了之后就会使人眼瞎，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:35:32.33+09:00">人们一定不会去看。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:35:39.146+09:00">如果有这样一种食物，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:35:50.087+09:00">吃到嘴里肯定感觉满足，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:36:13.745+09:00">但吃了之后就会使人声哑，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:36:18.525+09:00">人们一定不会去吃。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:36:37.49+09:00">因此，圣人对于音乐、色彩、美味的态度是，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:36:44.358+09:00">有利于生命的就取用，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:36:48.673+09:00">有害于生命的就舍弃，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:36:57.127+09:00">这是保全生命的方法。</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:37:15.302+09:00">世上富贵的人对于声色味的态度</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:37:23.735+09:00">大多是胡涂的，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:37:30.383+09:00">他们日日夜夜地追逐这些东西，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-12a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:39:44.92+09:00">一味享用这些东西，</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR3j0009_tls_001-13a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-07T18:38:49.281+09:00">生命怎么能不受伤害。</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
